    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Lane B · Email in\n**Trigger:** Gmail, unread in the VO mailbox.\n**Calls:** `POST /api/integrations/email/incoming-email`\n**Idempotency:** the Gmail message id.\n\n**Bound to the `Gmail account` credential.** The mailbox has not been chosen yet.\nSwap this node for IMAP if the client is not on Google.\n\n**This lane must never:** mark a mail read before the app has accepted it. A\nmail marked read on a failed POST is a change nobody ever sees again.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky7",
      "name": "Note 7",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -880,
