    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Lane C · Document watch\n**Trigger:** a file appears in the project's Drive folder.\n**Calls:** `POST /api/integrations/documents/uploaded`\n**Idempotency:** the Drive file id.\n\n`project_code` is read from the folder path. A file the app cannot place is\nrejected with a 4xx — it does not become a document on a guessed project.",
