    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Lane E · WhatsApp out (Evolution)\n**Trigger:** the app posts a queued WhatsApp notification here.\n**Sends:** `POST {VO_EVOLUTION_URL}/message/sendText/{VO_EVOLUTION_INSTANCE}`\n**Then:** reports delivery back, same as lane D.\n\n⚠️ **Use a SEPARATE Evolution instance from the outreach number.** Cold\noutreach on Baileys carries a real ban risk, and a ban is permanent. Sharing\none number means the day outreach gets the number banned is the day the\nproduct stops telling anyone about their notice deadlines.",
