    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Lane S · The schedules\nEverything this system does on a clock lives here, so it can be seen, paused\nand proved from one screen.\n\n| When | Job |\n|---|---|\n| 07:00 daily | `reminder_sweep` — who is late, who gets chased, who gets escalated |\n| Every 30 min, 07–19 | `notification_dispatch` — messages a lane could not take earlier |\n| 06:00 daily | `bottleneck_sweep` — what is blocked and how much is waiting on it |\n\n**What did NOT move here: deciding who is owed what.** That stays in the app,\nwhere the escalation ladder and the dedupe key are tested. As n8n nodes it\nwould be a diagram nobody can run twice safely, and a retried execution would\nchase the same project manager twice. A system that double-chases gets muted.\n\n**`If Execution Is Missed` is set to run the most recent missed execution.**\nA deploy at 07:00 must not cost a day of chasing.\n\n**Safe to fire twice.** Each job reads current state and works out what is owed\nnow; the dedupe key covers task, kind, day, channel and recipient.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 7
      },
