      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Lane H · Errors\nCatches a failure in any lane above and names the lane before anything else has\nto be opened — the whole reason node names carry a letter.\n\nRouting by lane letter is what makes one file per client bearable: the\nexecution list mixes eight lanes together, and without this you would be\nreading a stack trace to find out which one broke.\n\n⚠️ Set this workflow as its own **Error Workflow** in Settings, or nothing\nreaches here.",
