    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Lanes F and G · not built yet, on purpose\n\n**F · Client follow-up** and **G · Weekly report** are in the lane map and are\ndeliberately absent from this file.\n\nBoth need an app endpoint that does not exist yet. F chases a client for a\nresponse to a notice — and the app cannot yet issue a notice, so there is\nnothing to chase. G delivers a weekly commercial report the app cannot yet\nproduce.\n\nBuilding the couriers now would mean nodes wired to URLs that 404, which pass\nvalidation, sit in the workflow looking finished, and fail on the first day\nanyone relies on them. They arrive with the stage that gives them something to\ncarry.",
